    <formulas>
        <name>fIsJunkCompany</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(
ISBLANK({!$Record.Company}),
LEN(TRIM({!$Record.Company})) &lt; 4,
CONTAINS(&quot;|freelancer|freelance|self-employed|self employed|self|individual|individuals|n/a|na|none|team|personal|independent|myself|me|owner|private|test|unknown|retired|student|home|company|tbd|no company|not provided|[not provided]|&quot;, &quot;|&quot; + LOWER(TRIM({!$Record.Company})) + &quot;|&quot;)
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <description>Classifies leads created by SFMC integrations (any LeadSource beginning with "MC " - MC BizBash, MC Meetings, MC Travel, etc.) at insert (before save). Exact-email match to a Contact (uses its Account record type) or a prior open Lead determines Meeting/Sales vs Hosted Buyer lead record type. Default remains Hosted Buyer. v1 - see docs/FLOW_DESIGN_Lead_RecordType_Classification.md.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>MC Lead RecordType Classification {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>MC Lead RecordType Classification</label>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
